OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of bus hijacking
OL,4,Aappears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 39-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with a number of offences after
OL,8,Fa bus was hijacked in County Tyrone on
OL,9,FSaturday.
OL,11,FDaniel James Diver, 39, of Brigade
OL,12,FTerrace in Strabane appeared at
OL,13,FEnniskillen Magistrates Court on
OL,14,FMonday.
OL,16,FA police officer told the court that
OL,17,FDiver had made "full admissions" to
OL,18,Fpolice after he was arrested.
OL,20,FThe 13 charges include kidnapping,
OL,21,Fhijacking and aggravated vehicle taking
OL,22,Fcausing injury.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
